<title>USA: Data Race names chairman.</title>
<headline>Data Race names chairman.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO, Texas 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Data Race Inc said on Thursday that it has named Jeffrey Blanchard to serve as chairman, succeeding Herbert Hensley.</p>
<p>Hensley retired October 1, 1996, and will remain available to the company as a consultant, the company said.</p>
<p>Blanchard has been on the board of directors since 1985, said Data Race, a maker of communications products such as modems for notebook computers.</p>
